SageAttention pull request #368, gfx12 native port, by DELUXA
  https://github.com/thu-ml/SageAttention/pull/368
  The gfx12 (RDNA4) native extension (csrc/qattn/*gfx12_native*, the HIP build
  in setup.py, and the gfx12 paths in sageattention/core.py) come from this pull
  request. The upstream pull request carries the unmodified Apache-2.0 licence
  text and no separate NOTICE file.

Additions in this repository
  The hand-written gfx1201 fp8 attention kernel (kernels/hip/), its ctypes
  loader and code-object build script (sageattention/sk1_backend/sk1_loader.py,
  tools/build_hsaco.py), the fused fp8 quantiser (sageattention/sk1_backend/
  quant_*.py), the routing that sends fp16, head_dim 128 attention on gfx1201
  to that kernel, the tests and benchmarks, and the Triton research code under
  research/triton/ are original to this repository and are also released under
  Apache-2.0.

Changes to upstream files are limited to what the gfx12 port and the routing
require; comments and docstrings were revised.
